#: ../../introduction.rst:9
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr ""

#: ../../introduction.rst:11
msgid ""
"The *Apple School Manager Connector* is an app for :term:`UCS@school`. It"
" provisions the schools, classes, work groups, teachers, and students of "
"your UCS\\@school domain to :term:`Apple School Manager`, so that you "
"don't have to maintain the same accounts twice."
msgstr ""

#: ../../introduction.rst:16
msgid ""
"In this setup, UCS\\@school takes the role of the student information "
"system that Apple School Manager expects, and the connector uses the SFTP"
" interface that Apple provides for such systems. The connector collects "
"the data from the LDAP directory, writes it to a set of CSV files, packs "
"them into a ZIP archive, and uploads that archive to Apple School "
"Manager."
msgstr ""

#: ../../introduction.rst:27
msgid "Who this documentation is for"
msgstr ""

#: ../../introduction.rst:29
msgid ""
"This documentation addresses administrators who run a UCS\\@school domain"
" and who want to provision its users to Apple School Manager. It assumes "
"that you're familiar with the administration of :term:`UCS` and "
"UCS\\@school, in particular with the :term:`App Center`, the :term:`UCR`,"
" and the school objects that UCS\\@school manages."
msgstr ""

#: ../../introduction.rst:41
msgid "What you need"
msgstr ""

#: ../../introduction.rst:43
msgid "Before you start, make sure that you have the following:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../introduction.rst:45
msgid "A UCS\\@school domain with at least one school."
msgstr ""

#: ../../introduction.rst:47
msgid "An Apple School Manager account for an educational institution."
msgstr ""

#: ../../introduction.rst:49
msgid ""
"The SFTP credentials for the Apple School Manager account. :ref"
":`installation-credentials` describes where to find them."
msgstr ""

#: ../../introduction.rst:52
msgid ""
"A mail domain for your users. The connector only synchronizes users that "
"have a primary email address, because Apple School Manager uses the email"
" address as the Apple Account."
msgstr ""

#: ../../introduction.rst:59
msgid "What the connector synchronizes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../introduction.rst:61
msgid ""
"The connector transfers data in one direction only, from UCS\\@school to "
"Apple School Manager. It never reads data back, and it never changes "
"objects in your UCS\\@school domain."
msgstr ""

