#: ../../introduction.rst:100
msgid "Passwords and devices"
msgstr ""

#: ../../introduction.rst:102
msgid ""
"The connector never transfers passwords. Apple School Manager creates the"
" passwords for new accounts itself, and you distribute them from there. "
":ref:`configuration-password-policy` describes how to influence the "
"length of those passwords."
msgstr ""

#: ../../introduction.rst:108
msgid ""
"For device management, Univention recommends a mobile device management "
"solution that offers an interface to Apple School Manager. The "
"`Univention integration catalog <https://www.univention.com/products"
"/integration-catalog/>`_ lists the solutions that integrate with "
"UCS\\@school."
msgstr ""

